{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0001","task_id":"ml-data-split-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"为什么同一个任务的近重复样本不能随意分到 train 和 test？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"因为近重复样本会让模型在训练时见过测试题的内容或答案线索，导致测试分数虚高，不能反映泛化能力。应先按任务、原始来源或内容簇分组，再整体划分数据集；最后检查跨集合的精确重复和近重复。"}],"topic":"machine_learning.data_quality","difficulty":"basic","expected_verifier":"concept_review_and_duplicate_audit","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0002","task_id":"ml-overfit-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"训练损失持续下降，但验证损失开始上升，最可能说明什么？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"这通常是过拟合信号：模型越来越贴合训练集，却没有改善对未见数据的泛化。应检查数据泄漏和验证集代表性，并考虑早停、正则化、数据增强或降低模型容量。不能只凭这一条曲线就断言唯一原因。"}],"topic":"machine_learning.overfitting","difficulty":"basic","expected_verifier":"concept_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0003","task_id":"ml-grad-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"用一句话解释梯度下降。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"梯度下降反复计算目标函数对参数的梯度，并沿负梯度方向调整参数，以尝试降低目标函数值；学习率决定每次调整的步幅。"}],"topic":"machine_learning.optimization","difficulty":"basic","expected_verifier":"concept_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0004","task_id":"ml-distill-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"教师模型生成了一个答案，学生模型照着训练后就能算学会事实了吗？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"不能。教师答案只是候选标签，可能包含错误、遗漏或虚构来源。应保存教师版本和生成提示，对可验证事实使用独立来源，对代码使用测试，对数学使用可执行或可检查的推导；未通过验证的样本应隔离，不能冒充可靠真值。"}],"topic":"machine_learning.distillation","difficulty":"basic","expected_verifier":"policy_and_pipeline_test","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0005","task_id":"ml-sft-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"监督微调（SFT）数据最基本需要什么？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"至少需要输入上下文和期望输出，并明确样本格式、来源、质量状态与数据划分。训练集用于更新参数，验证集用于选择配置或检查过拟合，测试集用于最终独立评估。若目标答案没有可靠依据，应标为待审核而不是直接当作正确标签。"}],"topic":"machine_learning.supervised_finetuning","difficulty":"basic","expected_verifier":"schema_and_concept_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0006","task_id":"ml-loss-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"语言模型训练时，loss 下降能证明模型更聪明了吗？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"不能单独证明。loss 下降说明模型更好地拟合了训练目标，但能力提升还要看独立验证集上的损失、任务成功率、错误类型和泛化表现，并排除数据泄漏与评测污染。"}],"topic":"machine_learning.evaluation","difficulty":"basic","expected_verifier":"concept_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0007","task_id":"ml-replay-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"为什么持续学习系统要回放旧任务？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"回放旧任务可以检查新学习是否损害旧能力，并在训练中重现重要的历史分布，降低灾难性遗忘风险。回放集应有代表性、去重并受隐私与许可规则约束；只回放旧数据也可能导致偏差，因此仍需独立测试集。"}],"topic":"machine_learning.continual_learning","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_verifier":"concept_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0008","task_id":"ml-reward-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"为什么不能只奖励模型给出看起来完整的答案？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"因为流畅和完整不等于正确。奖励应尽量依赖与任务匹配的独立信号，例如单元测试、可复算结果、可靠来源或人工审核，并明确处理无法判定的情况。否则模型可能学会迎合评分方式，而不是解决真实问题。"}],"topic":"machine_learning.reward_design","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_verifier":"concept_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0009","task_id":"ml-curriculum-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"先训练小模型，再逐步扩大参数规模，有什么实验价值？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"它能先验证数据管线、损失计算、保存恢复、评测和资源测量是否正确，再把容量作为单独变量逐级增加。每一档都应记录参数量、token 数、训练步数、硬件、峰值内存和独立任务指标，否则无法判断改善来自模型规模还是其他变化。"}],"topic":"machine_learning.scaling_experiments","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_verifier":"experiment_protocol_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0010","task_id":"ml-selftrain-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"模型能不能把自己生成的答案直接加入训练集，不经检查？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"不应直接加入。未经检查的自生成答案可能把错误反复放大，形成自我强化的噪声循环。应先保存为候选，使用独立验证器或可信来源筛选，标记失败原因，并只把通过质量门槛的样本纳入训练；还要保留独立测试集监测退化。"}],"topic":"machine_learning.self_training","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_verifier":"pipeline_test_and_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0011","task_id":"python-jsonl-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"JSONL 文件应该如何组织？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"每一行放一个完整、独立且有效的 JSON 值，通常是一条 JSON 对象；行与行之间用换行符分隔，不要把整个文件包成一个 JSON 数组。读取时应逐行解析，并报告具体出错行号。"}],"topic":"software.jsonl","difficulty":"basic","expected_verifier":"jsonl_parser_test","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"automated_test_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0012","task_id":"python-dedupe-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"为什么数据去重前要先规范化空白和大小写？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"因为同一内容可能仅在空格、换行或大小写上不同，直接比较原始字符串会漏掉部分重复项。规范化能提高重复检测的一致性，但也可能把某些大小写敏感文本错误合并，所以应根据字段语义决定规范化规则，并保留原始记录以便追溯。"}],"topic":"data_engineering.deduplication","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_verifier":"unit_test_and_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0013","task_id":"python-hash-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"内容哈希适合用来做什么？它不能证明什么？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"内容哈希适合生成稳定的内容指纹、检测相同内容并追踪记录版本。它不能证明内容为真、来源有许可、没有隐私信息，也不能证明模型学会了内容。哈希相同或不同都应结合具体的规范化策略解释。"}],"topic":"data_engineering.hashing","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_verifier":"concept_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0014","task_id":"ai-memory-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"长期记忆、任务临时记忆和模型参数有什么区别？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"长期记忆保存跨任务仍有价值、可检索的事实和经验；任务临时记忆保存当前任务的中间状态与候选结果；模型参数通过训练编码统计规律和行为倾向。三者可以协作，但不能互相等同：写入记忆不代表参数已经更新，参数更新也不保证能准确回忆某条事实。"}],"topic":"ai_architecture.memory","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_verifier":"architecture_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0015","task_id":"ai-lifecycle-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"为什么任务结束后再统一整理记忆可能比每一步都重写长期记忆更合适？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"任务期间优先保存必要的临时状态，结束后再合并、去重、验证和压缩，可以减少重复写入与长期记忆被半成品污染的风险。代价是任务中断时需要可靠的检查点，因此应把可恢复的任务状态和最终的长期记忆结算分开设计。"}],"topic":"ai_architecture.task_lifecycle","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_verifier":"architecture_review_and_failure_test","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0016","task_id":"ai-ram-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"为什么模型文件大小不能直接代表 Android 应用的峰值 RAM？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"峰值 RAM 还可能包括运行时对象、激活值、KV cache、临时张量、执行缓冲区、后端分配和同时驻留的页面。文件映射大小也不等于实际驻留内存。应在目标设备上测量整应用峰值，并留出系统余量；硬内存上限不能被任务奖励抵消。"}],"topic":"systems.memory_budget","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_verifier":"device_measurement_protocol_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0017","task_id":"ai-budget-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"资源感知奖励里，如果任务成功但超过硬内存上限，应如何判定？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"应判定为未满足系统约束，不能让成功奖励抵消硬内存违规。可以分别记录任务质量、延迟和资源指标用于诊断，但最终准入必须先满足硬约束，再比较可行方案的质量与效率。"}],"topic":"systems.resource_aware_learning","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_verifier":"policy_test","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0018","task_id":"ai-eval-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"如何证明新训练版本比旧版本更好？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"在相同且未参与训练的测试任务上比较两版，预先定义成功标准，并同时报告质量、错误类型、延迟、内存和旧任务退化。尽可能固定评测环境、使用多个任务类别并记录随机种子。若差异不稳定或只改善训练集指标，就不能声称能力已可靠提升。"}],"topic":"machine_learning.model_release","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_verifier":"evaluation_protocol_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0019","task_id":"ai-provenance-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"训练样本为什么要保存来源、生成模型版本和提示版本？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"这些元数据让样本可以追溯、复现、分组审计，并在发现某批数据有系统性错误时定位和撤销。模型名或提示版本不能代替事实核验，但能说明样本是如何产生的。还应记录许可与隐私审查状态。"}],"topic":"data_engineering.provenance","difficulty":"basic","expected_verifier":"schema_and_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"aimeng.sft_candidate.v1","sample_id":"seed-0020","task_id":"ai-unknown-001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"当没有可靠办法判断一个开放式回答是否正确时，数据集应该怎么标记？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"应标记为 unknown 或 pending，并记录为什么无法验证。不要把教师自信程度当作正确性证据，也不要强行将样本标成 pass。此类样本可用于探索性分析，但在有明确训练策略和风险评估前，不应混入要求可靠真值的监督训练集。"}],"topic":"data_quality.uncertainty","difficulty":"basic","expected_verifier":"schema_and_review","verification":{"status":"pending","method":"independent_review_required","evidence":[]},"split":"unassigned","training_eligible":false}
